WEBVTT

01:38.100 --> 01:41.009
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.130 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 33]

01:48.509 --> 01:49.479
Sir, here's your pastry.

01:49.479 --> 01:50.080
Thank you.

01:52.350 --> 01:53.229
As a constable,

01:53.509 --> 01:54.910
you're completely weak.

01:55.280 --> 01:56.940
Well, I'm a female constable.

02:02.020 --> 02:02.790
Pastry.

02:03.430 --> 02:05.760
Sir, would you like to look at some fabric?

02:05.950 --> 02:07.950
They're all high-quality fabrics.

02:18.970 --> 02:23.510
[Linglong Cloth Store]

02:24.250 --> 02:25.120
Dear customers,

02:25.120 --> 02:26.320
welcome to our store.

02:28.960 --> 02:29.360
Sir,

02:29.630 --> 02:31.090
you've bought quite a lot.

02:31.240 --> 02:32.840
Are you setting up a new home?

02:32.910 --> 02:35.040
Someone must be newly married, right?

02:37.870 --> 02:39.200
You have a good eye, sir.

02:40.400 --> 02:41.860
You're quite perceptive.

02:44.710 --> 02:46.680
Congratulations, congratulations!

02:46.680 --> 02:47.680
Since you two are newlyweds,

02:47.680 --> 02:48.980
you must use high-quality bedding.

02:48.980 --> 02:50.050
Come, this way please.

02:50.050 --> 02:51.380
Let me introduce to you.

02:52.120 --> 02:52.840
Over here, we have

02:52.840 --> 02:53.970
the finest bedding.

02:54.000 --> 02:54.660
Take a look.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.240
For this fabric,

02:57.240 --> 02:58.470
comfort is the most important thing.

02:58.470 --> 03:00.070
Do you have anything better?

03:00.120 --> 03:00.680
This way.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.120
These are all excellent fabrics.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.180
Please take a look.

03:05.480 --> 03:07.210
Madam, you have such a good taste.

03:07.210 --> 03:08.870
After choosing the fabric...

03:48.470 --> 03:49.360
Take care, both of you.

03:49.360 --> 03:50.620
Welcome back anytime.

03:51.480 --> 03:52.210
I'll take it.

03:52.360 --> 03:52.890
Alright.

04:00.240 --> 04:00.770
Let's go.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.480
May you have a child soon!

04:14.270 --> 04:15.560
Thank you for your hard work.

04:15.560 --> 04:17.360
It's nothing worth mentioning.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.269
I also bought some

04:19.269 --> 04:20.310
medicinal food and supplements.

04:20.310 --> 04:22.640
There are some for you and some for Banxia.

04:22.720 --> 04:24.000
You're a doctor yourself,

04:24.000 --> 04:26.060
you should be able to tell them apart.

04:26.430 --> 04:26.830
Okay.

04:28.000 --> 04:28.530
Alright.

04:28.950 --> 04:30.630
Then we'll head back first.

04:30.880 --> 04:31.560
You two

04:31.560 --> 04:33.360
may recover without worry here.

04:33.520 --> 04:35.040
I left so suddenly last time,

04:35.040 --> 04:36.750
I don't know how much trouble it caused.

04:36.750 --> 04:39.150
I'm worried Wen Jian can't handle it alone.

04:41.340 --> 04:43.390
I'm sorry for being a burden to you all.

04:43.390 --> 04:44.480
Don't say that.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.010
We're all friends here,

04:46.010 --> 04:47.240
there's no need to be so polite.

04:47.240 --> 04:48.430
Banxia is a good girl.

04:48.430 --> 04:50.490
Don't let her suffer any grievances.

04:51.950 --> 04:52.750
I understand.

05:13.430 --> 05:14.090
Form ranks.

06:23.250 --> 06:24.130
Your ears...

06:27.040 --> 06:28.040
How did they heal?

06:30.070 --> 06:32.680
I was confined by the Peerless Bracelet for many years.

06:32.680 --> 06:34.190
Suddenly losing that restriction,

06:34.190 --> 06:35.450
my demon power surged.

06:35.720 --> 06:37.800
Plus, someone was causing trouble in the shadows.

06:37.800 --> 06:39.830
So I couldn't control myself for a while.

06:39.830 --> 06:41.600
But fortunately, during this time,

06:41.600 --> 06:42.560
I've figured out

06:42.630 --> 06:44.430
how to circulate my demon power.

06:44.510 --> 06:45.830
I used what my father once taught me,

06:45.830 --> 06:47.390
the secret technique of the Eight Pillar Sect.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.050
Gradually,

06:48.560 --> 06:50.090
I can control it at will now.

06:51.000 --> 06:51.730
That's good.

06:52.200 --> 06:52.720
This way,

06:52.720 --> 06:53.920
others won't be able to tell you're a demon.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.580
That's much more convenient.

06:56.070 --> 06:56.560
Indeed.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.040
Let's eat.

07:05.270 --> 07:05.930
Is it yummy?

07:07.720 --> 07:08.650
It's delicious.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.480
You're lying.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.970
They don't know how to cook.

07:12.970 --> 07:14.750
How would they know what ingredients to buy?

07:14.750 --> 07:15.680
Next time, I'll have to

07:15.680 --> 07:17.000
go to town myself

07:17.270 --> 07:19.000
to buy some tasty ingredients.

07:19.560 --> 07:21.420
Let me show you my cooking skills.

07:21.510 --> 07:22.710
Then I'll go with you.

07:23.190 --> 07:23.720
Alright.

07:35.920 --> 07:36.430
Xuanye,

07:37.950 --> 07:40.750
that person causing trouble in the shadows you mentioned,

07:40.750 --> 07:42.390
is it your elder brother?

07:44.270 --> 07:44.800
Yes.

07:48.240 --> 07:49.120
Is it the same person

07:49.120 --> 07:51.050
we saw at Chi Xue's grave last time?

07:55.920 --> 07:56.780
Are you scared?

07:57.680 --> 07:59.270
It's not that I'm scared.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.190
It's just that he keeps

08:01.190 --> 08:02.790
coming back again and again.

08:03.270 --> 08:04.240
It seems like he's not just

08:04.240 --> 08:06.040
trying to cause trouble for you.

08:09.240 --> 08:11.320
Is he asking you to go back home?

08:17.200 --> 08:18.530
Are you going to go back?

08:23.880 --> 08:24.920
If I go back,

08:25.360 --> 08:26.220
what about you?

08:27.210 --> 08:27.870
Besides,

08:29.070 --> 08:30.470
I can't bear to leave you.

08:37.480 --> 08:39.659
Alright, don't think too much about it.

08:39.659 --> 08:40.330
Let's eat.

08:42.150 --> 08:42.740
Okay.

08:45.120 --> 08:45.630
Xuanye,

08:46.630 --> 08:48.000
have you thought about how to explain to my parents

08:48.000 --> 08:49.460
when we return to Nanyang?

08:51.910 --> 08:53.790
I'll just tell them the truth.

08:55.070 --> 08:56.800
How can you tell them the truth?

08:58.270 --> 08:59.380
You definitely can't let them know

08:59.380 --> 09:00.670
about your true identity.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.270
Especially,

09:01.270 --> 09:02.930
you can't let my brother know.

09:03.870 --> 09:04.730
Think about it.

09:05.720 --> 09:07.720
My brother's marriage with Manniang

09:07.720 --> 09:09.080
was ruined by me.

09:10.010 --> 09:11.460
If he finds out

09:11.720 --> 09:12.670
that you're also a demon,

09:12.670 --> 09:14.130
it'll cause a huge uproar.

09:14.510 --> 09:16.570
I can already imagine what he'll say.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.980
You're a demon, Manniang is also a demon.

09:19.230 --> 09:20.550
So why can't he be with Manniang

09:20.550 --> 09:21.610
if I can be with you?

09:22.200 --> 09:24.000
But it's definitely different.

09:24.390 --> 09:26.050
Although you're both demons,

09:26.390 --> 09:28.240
Manniang is an evil demon.

09:28.550 --> 09:29.610
She killed people.

09:30.080 --> 09:31.000
No matter what,

09:31.730 --> 09:33.210
you can't marry

09:33.240 --> 09:34.630
a murderer, can you?

09:35.120 --> 09:36.600
But you're different.

09:37.160 --> 09:39.670
You uphold justice and are always willing to help others.

09:39.670 --> 09:41.320
Taking someone like you as a husband

09:41.320 --> 09:43.120
would be a tremendous blessing.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.220
Taking me as a husband?

09:48.730 --> 09:49.860
Marrying off to you.

09:50.150 --> 09:51.810
Marrying off to you works too.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.730
What are you smiling about?

10:00.270 --> 10:00.980
This year,

10:01.390 --> 10:03.250
you're turning nineteen, right?

10:04.600 --> 10:06.200
Why are you bringing that up?

10:06.390 --> 10:07.650
I'm just calculating,

10:07.960 --> 10:09.240
if we have a daughter,

10:10.150 --> 10:11.350
how long would it take

10:11.440 --> 10:13.170
for her to grow up to be like you?

10:16.600 --> 10:17.480
Don't always

10:17.480 --> 10:18.750
treat me like a child.

10:20.030 --> 10:20.630
Besides,

10:21.080 --> 10:22.030
you're not even married yet.

10:22.030 --> 10:23.960
Where did this daughter come from?

10:28.910 --> 10:31.200
Even if we do get married one day

10:31.790 --> 10:32.920
and have a daughter,

10:34.000 --> 10:35.800
she might not look like me at all.

10:36.360 --> 10:38.220
She might take after you instead.

10:39.800 --> 10:41.710
She would be a little panther.

10:47.690 --> 10:50.180
My daughter is a little panther.

10:52.750 --> 10:53.460
Xuanye,

10:55.550 --> 10:56.870
would our child

10:57.360 --> 10:58.720
know demonic spells?

11:01.270 --> 11:03.550
I suppose they would.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.470
Then how would I ever manage her?

11:07.840 --> 11:09.550
What clan do you belong to?

11:10.790 --> 11:12.190
The Mystic Panther Clan.

11:12.200 --> 11:14.530
The Mystic Panther Clan, so that means...

11:15.870 --> 11:17.670
She'll grow a tail,

11:18.000 --> 11:19.510
sharp teeth,

11:21.600 --> 11:22.840
have fur,

11:22.840 --> 11:24.510
and be fierce and strong.

11:26.080 --> 11:26.670
Banxia,

11:27.710 --> 11:29.830
would you feel wronged?

11:31.000 --> 11:31.720
About what?

11:33.630 --> 11:34.670
Being with me,

11:35.320 --> 11:36.980
not knowing if it's a blessing

11:37.260 --> 11:38.170
or a curse.

11:47.300 --> 11:49.960
Overthinking is pointless in most situations.

11:50.780 --> 11:52.400
If we can't change it,

11:53.510 --> 11:55.170
we should choose to accept it.

11:56.760 --> 11:59.540
If we always make things difficult for ourselves,

11:59.540 --> 12:01.540
we'll never get over such hurdles.

12:10.670 --> 12:11.320
Xuanye,

12:12.550 --> 12:13.960
no matter what happens,

12:15.580 --> 12:16.980
it's our fate.

12:18.670 --> 12:20.080
We just need to cherish it

12:20.080 --> 12:21.140
and that's enough.

12:28.080 --> 12:28.610
Alright,

12:29.240 --> 12:30.300
I'll listen to you.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.040
Moreover,

12:36.320 --> 12:37.120
who knows

12:37.720 --> 12:38.200
when will

12:38.200 --> 12:39.600
such a good thing happen?

12:44.790 --> 12:45.390
Let's eat.

12:51.240 --> 12:53.100
Did you catch that panther demon?

12:54.150 --> 12:55.390
I was incompetent, Master.

12:55.390 --> 12:56.250
I let it escape.

12:59.240 --> 12:59.900
Never mind.

13:01.120 --> 13:03.520
This was an unexpected bonus to begin with.

13:03.710 --> 13:04.770
Catch it if you can,

13:05.550 --> 13:07.480
but don't be obsessed if you can't.

13:08.320 --> 13:08.920
Chunmian,

13:12.070 --> 13:14.130
you must remember when you do things,

13:14.460 --> 13:16.300
never waver in your decisions

13:16.600 --> 13:17.930
and have too much greed.

13:18.390 --> 13:20.250
We only need to identify one goal,

13:20.320 --> 13:21.200
hold onto it

13:21.440 --> 13:23.040
tightly, and that's enough.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.170
You're right, Master.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.030
Master,

13:30.120 --> 13:32.320
this is what the panther demon dropped.

13:37.750 --> 13:40.080
The Bone Flute of the Mystic Panther Clan.

13:47.670 --> 13:48.730
This is exactly it.

13:49.720 --> 13:50.320
Chunmian.

13:51.150 --> 13:52.750
You've done a great service.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.130
This Bone Flute

13:56.830 --> 13:59.630
has the power to reveal and confuse the demon clan.

14:00.580 --> 14:01.340
With it,

14:02.150 --> 14:02.880
our plan

14:02.910 --> 14:04.310
will be even more secure.

14:08.870 --> 14:10.590
[Jingguan]

14:28.030 --> 14:29.030
Does it look good?

14:29.860 --> 14:30.660
It looks good.

14:32.030 --> 14:33.600
it's just a bit too big.

14:35.320 --> 14:38.050
Then let's go to town tomorrow to buy another one.

14:39.790 --> 14:41.010
It's getting late.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.920
We should get some rest soon.

14:50.550 --> 14:51.720
You go ahead and rest then.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.850
I'll sleep outside.

14:53.550 --> 14:54.350
Don't do that.

14:54.870 --> 14:56.120
There's not even a spot

14:56.120 --> 14:58.520
to shelter from the wind and rain out there.

15:00.240 --> 15:01.900
I'll fetch some water for you.

15:09.890 --> 15:13.140
♫When you're in love, your smile is like the spring breeze♫

15:13.770 --> 15:16.930
♫Walking beside me, bathed in moonlight♫

15:17.630 --> 15:21.140
♫No need for words, I already feel it♫

15:21.160 --> 15:24.700
♫Dark hair like ink, time stretches on♫

15:25.230 --> 15:28.610
♫When you're in love, you wish this love could last forever♫

15:29.020 --> 15:31.950
♫Leaning in close to whisper softly♫

15:32.210 --> 15:34.540
♫I miss you♫

15:34.780 --> 15:36.650
♫On every moonlit night♫

15:36.750 --> 15:41.030
♫Tenderness ties us together♫

15:42.280 --> 15:46.030
♫Let me take your hand and keep our promise♫

15:46.290 --> 15:49.530
♫You shake my soul and pull at my heartstrings♫

15:50.110 --> 15:51.980
♫If I think this world is beautiful♫

15:52.000 --> 15:53.730
♫It's partly because of the moon♫

15:53.870 --> 15:57.340
♫And mostly because I met you♫

15:57.740 --> 16:01.210
♫When life gets hard♫

16:01.780 --> 16:04.860
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

16:05.390 --> 16:07.250
♫This lingering love♫

16:07.270 --> 16:09.270
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

16:09.290 --> 16:11.980
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

16:12.070 --> 16:14.730
♫Right by my side♫

16:20.640 --> 16:24.170
♫When life gets hard♫

16:24.520 --> 16:27.800
♫All I wish for is to stay by your side♫

16:28.370 --> 16:30.250
♫This lingering love♫

16:30.280 --> 16:32.180
♫Is a treasure we both cherish♫

16:32.210 --> 16:34.890
♫When I turn around, you're there♫

16:35.010 --> 16:37.500
♫Right by my side♫

16:41.320 --> 16:41.790
Here.

16:46.540 --> 16:47.870
Where's Sima Lingying?

16:48.360 --> 16:49.290
She didn't come.

16:49.550 --> 16:52.080
It would be too conspicuous if both of us came.

16:53.660 --> 16:54.500
How is Xuanye?

16:55.030 --> 16:56.690
Has he found a place to settle?

16:56.870 --> 16:59.000
Xuanye found a courtyard outside the city.

16:59.000 --> 17:00.530
He's staying there for now.

17:01.040 --> 17:01.770
That's good.

17:02.030 --> 17:03.600
He should focus on recovering first.

17:03.600 --> 17:05.859
He can come back when things settle down.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.349
Why all the sighing?

17:18.150 --> 17:19.630
Isn't Xuanye fine now?

17:20.150 --> 17:21.609
No, you don't understand.

17:22.550 --> 17:25.520
He's been training in martial arts and cultivating with his father since childhood.

17:25.520 --> 17:26.950
After his family's tragic death,

17:26.950 --> 17:28.069
he took up his father's mantle

17:28.069 --> 17:29.480
and became a demon hunter.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.510
Although he's not exactly

17:30.510 --> 17:32.020
obsessed with hating demons,

17:32.020 --> 17:32.640
over the years,

17:32.640 --> 17:33.720
the number of demons he's defeated

17:33.720 --> 17:34.640
is countless.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.720
But now...

17:36.960 --> 17:39.420
Who would have thought he himself is a demon?

17:39.920 --> 17:40.850
I'm just worried

17:41.160 --> 17:43.360
he won't be able to come to terms with it.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.430
Our worrying won't help.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.810
This is his own matter.

17:48.510 --> 17:50.310
He has to figure it out on his own.

17:51.110 --> 17:51.910
You're right.

17:55.110 --> 17:56.920
How's the situation with Lord Geng?

17:56.920 --> 17:59.520
Has he investigated Banxia's disappearance?

18:00.070 --> 18:02.140
If he was going to, he would have done so already.

18:02.140 --> 18:02.910
Our Lord

18:03.000 --> 18:04.930
sees things as clearly as a mirror.

18:04.960 --> 18:06.820
He knows exactly what's going on,

18:06.820 --> 18:08.550
he just doesn't say it out loud.

18:09.480 --> 18:11.930
Lord Geng is a good official,

18:12.730 --> 18:13.730
but this incident

18:14.440 --> 18:16.440
has put him in a difficult position.

19:42.030 --> 19:42.830
You're awake.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.050
Why am I sleeping here?

19:49.240 --> 19:50.310
You're one to talk.

19:51.030 --> 19:53.160
Your wounds haven't fully healed yet.

19:53.430 --> 19:54.110
It's so cold at night.

19:54.110 --> 19:55.710
Why did you go sleep outside?

19:56.680 --> 19:58.920
Luckily, I woke up in the middle of the night

19:58.920 --> 20:00.010
and carried you inside.

20:00.010 --> 20:02.070
Otherwise, what if you caught a cold?

20:03.860 --> 20:05.220
You carried me in?

20:07.550 --> 20:08.310
You're so heavy.

20:08.310 --> 20:09.970
How could I possibly lift you?

20:10.030 --> 20:10.510
Of course I have to

20:10.510 --> 20:11.550
drag you in.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.350
Your wounds definitely haven't healed completely.

20:15.350 --> 20:16.680
Otherwise, when I was dragging you,

20:16.680 --> 20:18.280
why didn't you wake up at all?

20:19.250 --> 20:20.040
Tonight,

20:20.070 --> 20:21.720
you're not allowed to sleep outside again.

20:21.720 --> 20:23.250
Otherwise, I'll get angry.

20:25.750 --> 20:26.230
Okay.

20:27.550 --> 20:29.000
Go wash up quickly

20:29.110 --> 20:30.160
and change your clothes.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.420
I'll go make some food.

20:58.080 --> 20:59.200
Go sit down quickly.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.730
The food will be ready soon.

21:13.160 --> 21:13.880
Last night...

21:13.880 --> 21:14.550
Nothing.

21:15.920 --> 21:17.440
Nothing happened at all.

21:20.030 --> 21:21.960
It probably got chilly last night.

21:22.680 --> 21:23.760
You felt a bit cold,

21:23.790 --> 21:25.200
so you transformed back into your beast form.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.640
You came inside, found a warm spot,

21:26.640 --> 21:27.570
and fell asleep.

21:28.480 --> 21:30.340
My hand wasn't hurt by you either.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.310
I woke up in the middle of the night,

21:32.310 --> 21:34.040
and was startled when I saw you.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.810
So I accidentally sprained it myself.

21:37.070 --> 21:38.670
It has nothing to do with you.

21:42.110 --> 21:43.240
Go sit down quickly.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.730
The food will be ready soon.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.200
Xuanye,

21:58.790 --> 22:00.160
you mentioned last time

22:00.790 --> 22:03.790
your demon transformation was because of the Peerless Bracelet

22:03.790 --> 22:04.790
and your brother.

22:05.640 --> 22:07.440
So this time, could it be...

22:08.400 --> 22:09.130
It's not him.

22:10.300 --> 22:12.210
Before, he just wanted me to

22:12.240 --> 22:13.770
be clear about my identity.

22:15.590 --> 22:17.390
Now that he's achieved his goal,

22:17.770 --> 22:18.370
there's no reason

22:18.370 --> 22:20.100
for him to use that thing again.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.350
You trust him a lot.

22:24.320 --> 22:25.040
Zi Kong is my

22:25.070 --> 22:26.920
half-brother by a different mother.

22:26.920 --> 22:28.520
My mother passed away early.

22:28.830 --> 22:29.760
When I was young,

22:30.070 --> 22:32.070
he was always there to accompany me.

22:32.550 --> 22:34.210
Although he acts recklessly,

22:34.680 --> 22:36.210
he wouldn't really harm me.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.390
Have you finished eating?

22:43.390 --> 22:44.720
I'll go clean up.

22:44.750 --> 22:45.410
Let me do it.

22:58.440 --> 23:00.040
What are you thinking about?

23:03.200 --> 23:05.130
Don't always be so heavy-hearted.

23:06.440 --> 23:08.070
Thinking too much will make you age.

23:08.070 --> 23:09.730
You'll grow white hair again.

23:16.550 --> 23:17.280
What's this?

23:18.470 --> 23:20.270
It's a little Xuanye I embroidered myself.

23:20.270 --> 23:21.070
Isn't it cute?

23:27.510 --> 23:28.110
It's cute.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.000
It's for you.

23:38.640 --> 23:39.330
Xuanye,

23:40.730 --> 23:42.460
what's the Carefree Land like?

23:44.350 --> 23:45.680
Haven't you been there?

23:46.750 --> 23:48.550
I was still young at that time.

23:49.830 --> 23:51.050
Plus, I was so scared then,

23:51.050 --> 23:52.310
busy trying to escape.

23:52.480 --> 23:54.410
I didn't have time to see anything.

23:56.510 --> 23:57.400
Carefree Land

23:57.790 --> 23:59.480
is just a really vast world.

24:00.590 --> 24:02.050
Probably similar to here.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.490
What about your father?

24:10.070 --> 24:10.670
My father?

24:11.410 --> 24:13.340
What kind of person is your father?

24:16.510 --> 24:17.310
My father

24:18.960 --> 24:20.440
is a very powerful person.

24:25.030 --> 24:27.130
He's the leader of the Mystic Panther Clan,

24:27.130 --> 24:28.960
the Guardian King of the Carefree Land.

24:28.960 --> 24:30.290
He's usually very busy.

24:30.790 --> 24:32.790
Except during the grand clan meetings,

24:32.790 --> 24:34.050
I rarely get to see him.

24:36.920 --> 24:38.680
Actually, the Mystic Panther Clan

24:38.680 --> 24:39.400
has always been

24:39.400 --> 24:41.720
the guardians of the Carefree Land since ancient times,

24:41.720 --> 24:42.880
responsible for guarding

24:42.880 --> 24:44.940
the Realm Gate and the Carefree Herb.

24:50.070 --> 24:51.930
If your father is the clan leader,

24:54.550 --> 24:55.440
what about you?

24:57.480 --> 24:59.280
Do you want to be the clan leader?

25:03.750 --> 25:04.680
The clan leader.

25:05.070 --> 25:07.310
It seems impressive just by the way it sounds.

25:07.310 --> 25:09.550
Don't all men want to be officials?

25:10.160 --> 25:11.030
Do you want to?

25:12.400 --> 25:14.330
What exactly are you trying to ask?

25:18.080 --> 25:19.480
I don't know either.

25:22.120 --> 25:23.160
I'm just...

25:23.960 --> 25:25.160
a bit scared.

25:28.200 --> 25:30.790
I'm afraid that as your abilities grow stronger

25:30.790 --> 25:33.110
and you remember more things,

25:34.960 --> 25:35.880
you might

25:35.880 --> 25:37.480
want to go back home one day.

25:39.030 --> 25:40.160
I'm scared

25:41.070 --> 25:42.600
that you'll suddenly leave

25:43.830 --> 25:45.310
and leave me all alone.

25:50.470 --> 25:51.400
Don't be afraid.

25:52.480 --> 25:53.870
No matter what happens,

25:54.550 --> 25:55.950
I will always be with you.

28:01.930 --> 28:02.780
Xuanye,

28:05.040 --> 28:05.760
calm down.

28:05.790 --> 28:06.930
It's me, Banxia.

28:10.790 --> 28:11.460
Xuanye,

28:15.380 --> 28:17.310
it's me, Banxia. Wake up.

29:01.550 --> 29:02.070
Banxia.

29:03.070 --> 29:03.570
Banxia.

29:04.110 --> 29:04.590
Banxia!

29:12.310 --> 29:13.200
I'm fine.

29:19.440 --> 29:19.920
Banxia.

29:22.200 --> 29:22.680
Banxia!

30:23.170 --> 30:25.430
The pass token for the Underground City.

30:27.200 --> 30:28.400
Chief Constable Wen,

30:29.470 --> 30:30.640
we're off duty early today.

30:30.640 --> 30:31.770
Let's go see Xuanye.

30:32.510 --> 30:33.590
Tomorrow is our day off.

30:33.590 --> 30:34.650
Let's go tomorrow.

30:35.020 --> 30:35.420
Chief.

30:35.590 --> 30:36.120
Brother.

30:36.330 --> 30:37.070
I heard that Yanlai Restaurant

30:37.070 --> 30:37.830
has a new dancer

30:37.830 --> 30:38.440
who dances extremely well.

30:38.440 --> 30:39.200
Why don't we go for a drink?

30:39.200 --> 30:39.550
Sure.

30:40.070 --> 30:42.270
You guys go ahead. I'll head back first.

30:43.470 --> 30:44.930
In such a hurry to get home?

30:44.930 --> 30:45.720
Is it because Sima Lingying

30:45.720 --> 30:47.450
is still staying at your place?

30:54.050 --> 30:55.380
Mind your own business.

30:57.030 --> 30:59.090
Get ready for a wedding celebration.

31:21.440 --> 31:22.300
What happened?

31:22.840 --> 31:24.640
How did she get so badly injured?

31:25.110 --> 31:26.240
I need to trouble you

31:26.550 --> 31:28.410
to take care of Banxia for a while.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.200
Where are you going?

31:32.750 --> 31:34.550
I have something to take care of.

31:34.640 --> 31:35.680
If she wakes up,

31:36.400 --> 31:37.270
tell her

31:37.640 --> 31:38.700
to wait for me here.

31:41.640 --> 31:43.040
Can you tell us what it is?

31:46.110 --> 31:48.030
Banxia is seriously injured right now.

31:48.030 --> 31:49.890
Are you sure you want to leave now?

31:55.510 --> 31:56.840
I'm counting on you two.

32:01.750 --> 32:02.210
Xuanye!

32:12.370 --> 32:16.140
[Ganshan Clinic]

33:14.960 --> 33:15.420
Master.

33:18.270 --> 33:18.750
Xuanye,

33:20.480 --> 33:21.660
why are you back?

33:23.830 --> 33:24.400
Uncle,

33:26.070 --> 33:27.270
I've made a decision.

33:38.440 --> 33:38.970
Alright.

33:46.310 --> 33:46.770
Banxia.

33:50.690 --> 33:51.890
Lingying went out to buy some things.

33:51.890 --> 33:53.290
She asked me to remind you

33:53.590 --> 33:55.240
to take your medicine on time.

33:55.240 --> 33:55.840
Thank you.

33:59.640 --> 34:01.310
Did Xuanye say anything else?

34:03.680 --> 34:05.240
Xuanye asked you to rest well and recover.

34:05.240 --> 34:08.170
He'll come back to you once he finished his business.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.639
Don't overthink it.

34:11.150 --> 34:12.949
Xuanye isn't a reckless person.

34:13.010 --> 34:13.630
He must have

34:13.630 --> 34:15.159
his reasons for doing this.

34:15.280 --> 34:16.040
Yes,

34:17.710 --> 34:19.480
he always has his own reasons.

34:26.280 --> 34:27.480
Chief Constable Chu,

34:28.230 --> 34:30.110
could you help me hire a carriage?

34:30.840 --> 34:32.370
I want to return to Nanyang.

34:33.670 --> 34:35.630
Why do you suddenly want to go back to Nanyang?

34:35.630 --> 34:37.090
I've been away for so long.

34:37.320 --> 34:39.510
My family must be worried.

34:42.580 --> 34:43.590
I know

34:43.590 --> 34:44.920
you're angry at Xuanye.

34:45.630 --> 34:47.030
Maybe he'll be back soon.

34:47.190 --> 34:48.650
Why don't you wait for him?

34:50.190 --> 34:51.000
I'm not angry.

34:52.590 --> 34:53.960
I like him so much.

34:54.590 --> 34:55.590
I know what kind of person

34:55.590 --> 34:56.710
he is.

34:58.750 --> 35:01.000
No matter where, I'll still be waiting for him.

35:01.000 --> 35:02.530
I might as well wait at home.

35:05.110 --> 35:05.920
Besides,

35:07.320 --> 35:08.670
it's inconvenient for you

35:08.670 --> 35:10.470
to have me staying at your place.

35:11.150 --> 35:12.480
How is it inconvenient?

35:12.800 --> 35:13.710
Lingying is here,

35:13.710 --> 35:15.040
she can take care of you.

35:16.110 --> 35:18.110
I don't want to trouble you anymore.

35:23.600 --> 35:28.820
[Ganshan Clinic]

35:58.750 --> 35:59.510
Watch where you're going!

35:59.510 --> 36:00.310
Are you blind?

36:30.710 --> 36:31.420
What a coincidence.

36:31.420 --> 36:32.340
We meet again.

36:32.880 --> 36:34.080
What happened to you?

36:34.360 --> 36:35.360
Did you hit a snag?

36:44.030 --> 36:45.880
I have no intention of being your enemy.

36:45.880 --> 36:46.940
Stop following me.

36:47.320 --> 36:48.560
Who's following you?

36:49.070 --> 36:50.600
I have something to ask you.

36:51.230 --> 36:53.230
Did you know that Xuanye left again?

36:55.320 --> 36:56.920
I heard you two are brothers.

36:57.150 --> 36:58.510
You bully your brother so much,

36:58.510 --> 36:59.710
do your parents know?

37:01.000 --> 37:02.000
When did he leave?

37:02.920 --> 37:04.050
I'm not telling you.

37:04.150 --> 37:05.070
Where did he go?

37:05.480 --> 37:07.210
That's what I wanted to ask you.

37:07.400 --> 37:08.360
At first, we thought

37:08.360 --> 37:09.920
you came back to provoke him again.

37:09.920 --> 37:11.520
But seeing you in this state,

37:11.710 --> 37:13.710
it seems you're not capable of that.

37:14.590 --> 37:15.590
I'm very curious.

37:15.880 --> 37:17.230
Who did this to you?

37:18.070 --> 37:18.760
Tell me,

37:19.360 --> 37:20.420
so I can thank them.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.170
What are you looking at?

37:35.230 --> 37:36.440
Even if you want to leave,

37:36.440 --> 37:38.190
there's no need to be in such a hurry.

37:38.190 --> 37:39.990
Sima Lingying went to buy stuff.

37:40.120 --> 37:42.180
Why don't you wait until she returns?

37:43.880 --> 37:45.280
I think it's still early.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.100
Could you wait for her?

37:47.370 --> 37:48.150
Chief Constable Chu,

37:48.150 --> 37:49.360
it's not early anymore.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.320
If we wait a bit longer,

37:50.320 --> 37:51.840
we might as well leave tomorrow.

37:51.840 --> 37:52.970
Tomorrow works too.

37:53.310 --> 37:54.710
How about you leave tomorrow?

37:54.710 --> 37:55.910
Chief Constable Chu.

37:56.710 --> 37:57.310
Youhuang.

38:03.190 --> 38:03.870
Who is this?

38:04.360 --> 38:05.800
This is Physician Jiu's brother,

38:05.800 --> 38:07.200
the other panther demon.

38:21.710 --> 38:22.190
Xuanye.

38:23.760 --> 38:24.230
Xuanye.

38:27.360 --> 38:29.220
To suppress your demonic nature,

38:29.360 --> 38:29.880
you even went as far as

38:29.880 --> 38:31.320
forcibly reversing your qi and blood.

38:31.320 --> 38:33.110
This method is extremely dangerous.

38:33.110 --> 38:33.970
Let me tell you,

38:34.670 --> 38:35.870
this is the only time.

38:36.230 --> 38:38.160
You're not allowed to use it again.

38:39.230 --> 38:40.070
I previously

38:40.450 --> 38:41.190
had mastered the method

38:41.190 --> 38:42.590
to control my demon form.

38:43.510 --> 38:44.590
Why now

38:44.920 --> 38:46.450
can't I control it anymore?

38:48.280 --> 38:49.400
I don't know either.

38:49.400 --> 38:49.880
Uncle,

38:50.630 --> 38:51.300
you've lived in the Underground City

38:51.300 --> 38:52.450
for so many years,

38:53.000 --> 38:54.510
often interacting and

38:54.590 --> 38:55.710
and doing business with demons.

38:55.710 --> 38:57.360
Haven't you heard

38:58.280 --> 38:59.590
anything about this?

39:01.150 --> 39:02.950
You should drink some tea first.

39:08.630 --> 39:09.480
I only know

39:10.350 --> 39:12.210
My brother has a secret treasure,

39:12.730 --> 39:13.990
called the Bone Flute.

39:14.850 --> 39:16.080
It can temporarily

39:16.110 --> 39:17.170
make me lose my mind

39:17.400 --> 39:18.880
and lose control of my demon form.

39:18.880 --> 39:19.610
Previously,

39:20.140 --> 39:21.510
he used this method

39:21.880 --> 39:23.740
to force me to reveal my true form.

39:23.840 --> 39:24.440
Xuanye,

39:26.110 --> 39:27.170
if that's the case,

39:27.920 --> 39:30.280
he must be involved in this matter.

39:31.110 --> 39:31.970
How about this?

39:32.150 --> 39:33.480
I'll assign more people

39:33.480 --> 39:35.070
to find him for you.

39:37.030 --> 39:38.760
Thank you for your help, Uncle.

39:41.480 --> 39:42.540
Where's Miss Duan?

39:47.070 --> 39:47.930
She's injured.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.180
Injured by you?

39:54.230 --> 39:54.800
Uncle,

39:56.710 --> 39:57.970
you mentioned a method

39:59.150 --> 40:01.280
to transform from a demon into a human,

40:01.670 --> 40:02.870
does it really exist?

40:06.150 --> 40:08.680
There's no turning back once you've started.

40:09.360 --> 40:10.820
Have you made up your mind?

40:30.040 --> 40:31.040
Why are you here?

40:31.070 --> 40:31.980
Who hurt you?

40:33.510 --> 40:34.840
What does it have to do with you?

40:34.840 --> 40:36.010
Of course it does.

40:37.480 --> 40:38.800
You are Xuanye's brother.

40:38.800 --> 40:40.860
Although you're not friendly to him,

40:40.920 --> 40:42.070
you're still of the same kind.

40:42.070 --> 40:43.290
Your demon powers are strong.

40:43.290 --> 40:44.410
Whoever can hurt you

40:44.410 --> 40:45.110
must be able to hurt him too.

40:45.110 --> 40:46.640
Of course I need to find out.

40:46.880 --> 40:47.880
I don't know them.

40:49.190 --> 40:50.520
There were many of them.

40:51.000 --> 40:53.000
They're all skilled demon hunters.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.300
Their leader

40:54.550 --> 40:55.280
is quite old,

40:56.280 --> 40:57.940
and seems to be in poor health.

40:59.190 --> 41:00.050
Where are they?

41:00.950 --> 41:02.210
The Underground City.

41:04.550 --> 41:05.130
Why did they

41:05.130 --> 41:05.930
do this to you?

41:06.400 --> 41:07.000
Man Ying

41:08.420 --> 41:09.280
must have told you

41:09.280 --> 41:10.480
about my background.

41:10.550 --> 41:11.880
The 12th year is coming.

41:12.280 --> 41:13.740
When the Realm Gate opens,

41:13.880 --> 41:15.880
it will be our chance to return home.

41:16.280 --> 41:18.040
My purpose coming to the human world this time

41:18.040 --> 41:19.440
is to bring him back home.

41:19.660 --> 41:20.410
In 12 years,

41:20.440 --> 41:22.030
the gate only opens once.

41:22.230 --> 41:23.690
How did you come here then?

41:23.710 --> 41:24.710
I have my own way.

41:25.760 --> 41:27.670
But this method has limitations,

41:28.340 --> 41:30.670
only one person can pass through at a time.

41:31.760 --> 41:33.510
When I came out of the Realm Gate,

41:33.510 --> 41:36.910
I noticed something unusual about the pool water at the gate.

41:40.150 --> 41:40.810
After that,

41:41.280 --> 41:42.680
I saw that group of people

41:42.920 --> 41:44.450
bringing in a flower demon,

41:44.840 --> 41:45.570
telling her,

41:46.360 --> 41:48.400
"If you jump into this Bone Washing Pool,

41:48.400 --> 41:50.190
you can wash away your demonic roots

41:50.190 --> 41:51.790
and transform into a human."

41:56.510 --> 41:58.510
What happened to that flower demon?

41:58.920 --> 41:59.520
It's dead.

42:01.110 --> 42:02.510
Then they discovered me.

42:03.030 --> 42:04.230
So I fought with them.

42:05.630 --> 42:07.160
There were too many of them,

42:07.480 --> 42:09.230
and I was also worried about Man Ying,

42:09.230 --> 42:10.030
so I left.

42:10.230 --> 42:12.530
So, this is the reason why

42:12.760 --> 42:14.220
they're hunting you down.

42:14.320 --> 42:14.880
Perhaps.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.100
After that,

42:17.670 --> 42:18.930
they kept tracking me.

42:20.030 --> 42:21.690
I let my guard down for a moment

42:22.320 --> 42:23.850
and fell into their ambush.

42:24.840 --> 42:25.320
Oh no.

42:25.480 --> 42:26.280
What's wrong?

42:27.150 --> 42:28.410
I suddenly remembered

42:29.150 --> 42:31.530
Xuanye's Uncle had previously asked him

42:32.240 --> 42:33.570
if he wanted to be a demon

42:33.590 --> 42:34.550
or a human.

42:34.800 --> 42:35.730
He could choose.

42:38.880 --> 42:39.630
The leader

42:40.190 --> 42:41.320
is Man Ying's Uncle?

42:42.510 --> 42:43.830
Then, could it be...

42:47.030 --> 42:48.320
Are you sure that the Bone Washing Pool

42:48.320 --> 42:50.030
can't turn demons into humans?

42:50.030 --> 42:50.630
Of course.

42:51.100 --> 42:52.430
I saw it with my own eyes.

42:55.840 --> 42:56.970
It seems that old man

42:57.400 --> 42:59.330
wants to trick Man Ying into it too.

43:00.110 --> 43:00.650
No way.

43:00.840 --> 43:02.480
I need to go to the Underground City.

43:02.480 --> 43:03.230
I'll go with you.

43:03.230 --> 43:04.190
Let's go together.

43:04.190 --> 43:04.850
I'll go too.

43:05.440 --> 43:06.800
Wen Jian, you'd better not go.

43:06.800 --> 43:07.930
It's too dangerous.

43:08.070 --> 43:09.320
Besides, the government office needs someone.

43:09.320 --> 43:10.120
You stay here.

43:10.960 --> 43:12.420
If anything happens to us,

43:12.510 --> 43:13.640
you report to My Lord

43:13.800 --> 43:15.630
to have someone come down to rescue us.

43:15.630 --> 43:16.560
We should hurry.

43:16.590 --> 43:18.190
Then let's set off immediately.

43:18.190 --> 43:18.480
Alright.

43:18.480 --> 43:18.880
Okay.

43:21.150 --> 43:22.750
As if lambs to the slaughter.

43:28.590 --> 43:29.640
I'll go with you.

43:30.760 --> 43:32.110
Look at you, acting all capable.

43:32.110 --> 43:33.840
If we are lambs to the slaughter,

43:33.840 --> 43:35.900
who were the ones who tied you up here?

43:41.300 --> 43:41.840
Let's go.
